msgstr "Novi čarobnjak za pozjamice"

#. i18n: ectx: attribute (title), widget (QWizardPage, LendBorrowWizardPageDecl)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/lendborrowwizardpagedecl.ui:6
